sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor AU as Internal auditor
  participant CK as Cockpit
  participant ENG as Rule Engine
  participant LOG as Decision log (monthly partitions)
  AU->>CK: Decisions, rule set credit-card-eligibility, 12 Jan 2027
  CK->>ENG: GET /decisions?ruleSet=...&from=...&to=...
  ENG->>LOG: read partition 2027-01
  alt partition older than retention was dropped
    LOG-->>ENG: no rows
    ENG-->>CK: empty result, retention setting explains why
  else found
    LOG-->>ENG: entry
    ENG-->>CK: version 3, clock, inputs (masked), matched R4, outputs, caller
  end
  AU->>CK: open version 3
  CK->>ENG: GET version 3 with requester, approver, dates
  ENG-->>CK: rows as approved, approval record
  AU->>CK: Simulation of published v3 with the logged inputs and clock
  CK->>ENG: simulate pinned v3, clock 2027-01-12T09:14Z (nothing logged)
  ENG-->>CK: same outputs, same matched row R4
  AU->>CK: export evidence (REST JSON in M1, export screen in M3)
